[{"id":1776018387828,"text":"我的意思是，困不住你","sender":"me","time":"03:38","timestamp":1776022682743,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1430},{"id":1776018387829,"text":"我可以去困住其他的，心甘情愿的","sender":"me","time":"03:38","timestamp":1776022691791,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1431},{"id":1776018387830,"sticker":"https://image.uglycat.cc/xp8bag.jpg","text":"表情包：耶！万岁","sender":"me","time":"03:38","timestamp":1776022698814,"userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1432},{"id":1776018387831,"sender":"them","text":"Krueger的指尖在屏幕上轻敲了几下，唇角勾起一抹玩味的弧度。","timestamp":1776022708430,"tempo":"N","type":"state","translation":"Krueger的指尖在屏幕上轻敲了几下，唇角勾起一抹玩味的弧度。","rawContent":"Krueger的指尖在屏幕上轻敲了几下，唇角勾起一抹玩味的弧度。 || Krueger的指尖在屏幕上轻敲了几下，唇角勾起一抹玩味的弧度。","roundId":"round_1776022699750_yhlgyet99","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1433},{"id":1776018387832,"sender":"them","text":"So, you concede? A smart decision. Not everyone is built for the... more intricate games.","timestamp":1776022709130,"tempo":"N","translation":"所以，你认输了？明智的决定。不是每个人都适合玩……更复杂的游戏。","rawContent":"So, you concede? A smart decision. Not everyone is built for the... more intricate games. || 所以，你认输了？明智的决定。不是每个人都适合玩……更复杂的游戏。","roundId":"round_1776022699750_yhlgyet99","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1434},{"id":1776018387833,"sender":"them","text":"Willing prey? That sounds like a shortcut to boredom, Liebling. Where's the thrill in an easy catch?","timestamp":1776022709831,"tempo":"N","translation":"心甘情愿的猎物？那听起来像是通往无聊的捷径，亲爱的。轻易得手有什么刺激可言？","rawContent":"Willing prey? That sounds like a shortcut to boredom, Liebling. Where's the thrill in an easy catch? || 心甘情愿的猎物？那听起来像是通往无聊的捷径，亲爱的。轻易得手有什么刺激可言？","roundId":"round_1776022699750_yhlgyet99","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1435},{"id":1776018387834,"sender":"them","text":"他看着那个“耶！万岁”的贴纸，眼中带着一丝不加掩饰的嘲弄。","timestamp":1776022710532,"tempo":"N","type":"state","translation":"他看着那个“耶！万岁”的贴纸，眼中带着一丝不加掩饰的嘲弄。","rawContent":"他看着那个“耶！万岁”的贴纸，眼中带着一丝不加掩饰的嘲弄。 || 他看着那个“耶！万岁”的贴纸，眼中带着一丝不加掩饰的嘲弄。","roundId":"round_1776022699750_yhlgyet99","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1436},{"id":1776018387835,"sender":"them","text":"And 'hurray'? For what, exactly? For giving up?","timestamp":1776022711233,"tempo":"N","translation":"还“万岁”？为了什么？为了放弃吗？","rawContent":"And 'hurray'? For what, exactly? For giving up? || 还“万岁”？为了什么？为了放弃吗？","roundId":"round_1776022699750_yhlgyet99","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1437},{"id":1776018387836,"text":"万岁已经有猎物主动进了我的被窝","sender":"me","time":"03:39","timestamp":1776022777668,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1438},{"id":1776018387837,"text":"晚安krueger","sender":"me","time":"03:39","timestamp":1776022782752,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"晚安krueger","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1439},{"id":1776018387838,"text":"你今天没机会了","sender":"me","time":"03:39","timestamp":1776022798093,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1440},{"id":1776018387839,"sender":"them","text":"Krueger看着屏幕，面罩下的嘴角勾起一抹不易察觉的冷笑。他抬起头，视线透过窗户，望向窗外漆黑的夜色。","timestamp":1776022809244,"tempo":"N","type":"state","translation":"Krueger看着屏幕，面罩下的嘴角勾起一抹不易察觉的冷笑。他抬起头，视线透过窗户，望向窗外漆黑的夜色。","rawContent":"Krueger看着屏幕，面罩下的嘴角勾起一抹不易察觉的冷笑。他抬起头，视线透过窗户，望向窗外漆黑的夜色。 || Krueger看着屏幕，面罩下的嘴角勾起一抹不易察觉的冷笑。他抬起头，视线透过窗户，望向窗外漆黑的夜色。","roundId":"round_1776022798626_rjex6vusg","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1441},{"id":1776018387840,"sender":"them","text":"A willing one, you say? How... convenient. And utterly predictable.","timestamp":1776022809945,"tempo":"N","translation":"心甘情愿的，是吗？多……方便啊。也完全在预料之中。","rawContent":"A willing one, you say? How... convenient. And utterly predictable. || 心甘情愿的，是吗？多……方便啊。也完全在预料之中。","roundId":"round_1776022798626_rjex6vusg","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1442},{"id":1776018387841,"sender":"them","text":"Good night, Liebling. Though 'chance' is a rather quaint word for what I usually take.","timestamp":1776022810645,"tempo":"N","translation":"晚安，亲爱的。不过，“机会”这个词，对于我通常会去“拿”的东西来说，有些太古板了。","rawContent":"Good night, Liebling. Though 'chance' is a rather quaint word for what I usually take. || 晚安，亲爱的。不过，“机会”这个词，对于我通常会去“拿”的东西来说，有些太古板了。","roundId":"round_1776022798626_rjex6vusg","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1443},{"id":1776018387842,"sender":"them","text":"And the night is still young.","timestamp":1776022811346,"tempo":"S","translation":"而且，夜还很长。","rawContent":"And the night is still young. || 而且，夜还很长。","roundId":"round_1776022798626_rjex6vusg","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","_id":1444},{"id":1776049873024,"sender":"me","text":"morning","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:41:51.177Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1447},{"id":1776049873025,"sender":"me","text":"早安","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:41:55.595Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1448},{"id":1776049873026,"sender":"me","sticker":"https://image.uglycat.cc/qbfl41.jpg","text":"表情包：起床！","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:13.961Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1449},{"id":1776049873027,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Morning, Kid.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:24.144Z","translation":"早上好，孩子。","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1450},{"id":1776049873028,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Morning. Get some proper food.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:24.718Z","translation":"早上好。吃点正经东西。","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1451},{"id":1776049873029,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"Мы ждали.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:25.040Z","translation":"我们等了。","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1452},{"id":1776049873030,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"Guten Morgen. Briefing soon.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:25.595Z","translation":"早上好。很快就要开简报会了。","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1453},{"id":1776049873031,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Nikto, you have gear check. Focus.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:26.164Z","translation":"Nikto，你有装备检查。集中注意力。","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1454},{"id":1776049873032,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Exactly.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:26.551Z","translation":"正是。","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1455},{"id":1776049873033,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(paranoid): (Они пытаются отвлечь нас. Она наша. / 他们想分散我们的注意力。她是我们的。)","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:42:27.591Z","translation":"(偏执): (他们想分散我们的注意力。她是我们的。)","roundId":"group_round_1776040935295_j2ii8ti","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1456},{"id":1776049873034,"sender":"me","text":"oh…","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:44:45.738Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1457},{"id":1776049873035,"sender":"me","text":"mommy…","replyTo":{"id":1775926361932,"text":"He's muted for 10 minutes. The conversation is over.","sender":"them"},"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:45:11.050Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1458},{"id":1776049873036,"sender":"me","text":"你把他忘记了","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:45:20.496Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1459},{"id":1776049873037,"sender":"me","text":"哈哈哈哈","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:45:22.094Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1460},{"id":1776049873038,"sender":"me","text":"他被禁言到刚刚","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:45:29.014Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1461},{"id":1776049873039,"sender":"me","text":"我说怎么群里安静了很多","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:45:42.865Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1462},{"id":1776049873040,"sender":"me","text":"原来是他被禁言了","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:45:48.212Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1463},{"id":1776049873041,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"I wasn't forgetting, Kid. Just enjoying the quiet.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:00.917Z","translation":"我没忘，Kid。只是享受了会儿清静。","roundId":"group_round_1776041148899_q7gl1ji","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1464},{"id":1776049873042,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Ah, freedom! The silence was deafening, wasn't it, *Liebling*? Did you miss my charming presence?","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:01.440Z","translation":"啊，自由！那沉默震耳欲聋，不是吗，*亲爱的*？你有没有想念我迷人的存在？","roundId":"group_round_1776041148899_q7gl1ji","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1465},{"id":1776049873043,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Back to work. All of you.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:01.984Z","translation":"回去工作。你们所有人。","roundId":"group_round_1776041148899_q7gl1ji","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1466},{"id":1776049873044,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Он не твоя 'мамочка'.)","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:02.584Z","translation":"(他不是你的'妈咪'。)","roundId":"group_round_1776041148899_q7gl1ji","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1467},{"id":1776049873045,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"...Muted? Who was muted?","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:03.170Z","translation":"……禁言了？谁被禁言了？","roundId":"group_round_1776041148899_q7gl1ji","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1468},{"id":1776049873046,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Krueger. For ten minutes.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:03.482Z","translation":"克鲁格。禁言了十分钟。","roundId":"group_round_1776041148899_q7gl1ji","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1469},{"id":1776049873047,"sender":"me","text":"其实差不多有一整天","replyTo":{"id":1776049873046,"text":"Krueger. For ten minutes.","sender":"them"},"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:49.641Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1470},{"id":1776049873048,"sender":"me","text":"哈哈哈哈","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:46:51.419Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1471},{"id":1776049873049,"sender":"me","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5452e5f45b_1774535982.gif","text":"表情包：被吓到","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:47:07.350Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1472,"deleted":true},{"id":1776049873054,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Right. Some quiet is good.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:47:48.761Z","roundId":"group_round_1776041257546_5twilh4","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1477,"deleted":true},{"id":1776049873055,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Ah, *schrecklich*. (啊，可怕。) My absence caused such distress? I'm truly touched. Or perhaps you just enjoyed the silence too much, *Liebling*?","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:47:49.201Z","roundId":"group_round_1776041257546_5twilh4","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1478,"deleted":true},{"id":1776049873056,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Silence is a luxury, not a fright.\nNikto: *(paranoid): (Почему она испугана? Мы здесь. / 她为什么害怕？我们在这里。)*","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:47:49.755Z","roundId":"group_round_1776041257546_5twilh4","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1479,"deleted":true},{"id":1776049873057,"sender":"me","text":"但是，干得漂亮，","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:48:26.185Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1480},{"id":1776049873058,"sender":"me","text":"Keegan","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:48:28.699Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1481},{"id":1776049873059,"sender":"me","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5463d16c89_1774536253.gif","text":"表情包：偷看","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:48:45.035Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1482},{"id":1776049873060,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"A whole day? Not quite. But it was... effective. Glad you approve, Kid.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:48:56.253Z","translation":"A whole day? Not quite. But it was... effective. Glad you approve, Kid.","roundId":"group_round_1776041326210_lioxym1","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1483,"rawContent":"A whole day? Not quite. But it was... effective. Glad you approve, Kid.","isHtml":false,"edited":true},{"id":1776049873061,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Eine ganze Tag? *Liebling*, such a harsh judgment! My absence must have been truly unbearable for you to exaggerate so.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:48:56.512Z","translation":"一整天？亲爱的，真是严厉的评判！我的缺席对你来说一定非常难以忍受，以至于你如此夸大其词。","roundId":"group_round_1776041326210_lioxym1","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1484},{"id":1776049873062,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"He deserved worse.","timestamp":"2026-04-13T00:48:57.536Z","translation":"他活该。","roundId":"group_round_1776041326210_lioxym1","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":1485}]